    "SteeringVerb": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "description": "Steering verbs (`contracts:gateway-protocol`). Drain semantics: `Steer` is drained at tool-launch boundaries only — before each sequential launch and once before a parallel batch's atomic launch; a running tool is never cancelled; skipped unstarted calls receive paired synthetic tool results. `Inject` waits silently until a waking message.",
      "oneOf": [
